    "chunk_text": "Joining her as the international keynote speaker is Zoho Corporation Director and Zoho Schools of Learning President Rajendran Dandapani from India. Representing one of the world\u2019s leading technology companies, Dandapani will share global perspectives on entrepreneurship, leadership, innovation and talent development, drawing on Zoho\u2019s internationally recognised people-first approach to building sustainable businesses.\n\nSmall and medium-sized enterprises continue to play a vital role in Sri Lanka\u2019s economy by generating employment, driving innovation and contributing significantly to economic growth. Through platforms such as the national conference, BNI Sri Lanka remains committed to strengthening the country\u2019s entrepreneurial ecosystem by connecting business owners with global knowledge, trusted relationships and opportunities for sustainable business growth.\n\nBNI Sri Lanka National Director Hemu Suvarna said, \u201cThe BNI Sri Lanka National Conference is our flagship event that brings together members from across Sri Lanka and the global BNI network to learn, connect and grow. This year\u2019s keynote speakers represent excellence in entrepreneurship and innovation and we are delighted to provide our members with the opportunity to learn from two outstanding business leaders whose experiences offer valuable lessons for businesses of every size.\u201d\n\nBNI Sri Lanka National Conference 2026 is expected to welcome hundreds of BNI members, reaffirming the organisation\u2019s commitment to creating opportunities for collaboration, knowledge sharing and sustainable business growth through one of the world\u2019s most connected business communities."
